    excerpt:
      "IMF July Update vs our April WEO research print: goods+services trade volume jumps from 2.8% to 3.5% for 2026, world GDP ticks down −0.1 pp to 3.0%, and headline CPI rises +0.3 pp to 4.7% as oil hits $89/bbl.",
